# Local settings by default

When Vladimir asks to change settings (Cursor/VS Code `settings.json`, git config, Maven, env, CLI config, formatter,
etc.):

- Apply them **locally to the current workspace/repo** (e.g. `.vscode/settings.json`, `git config --local`, repo `.mvn`,
  project files).
- Do **not** change user/global/machine-wide config unless he explicitly says global/user-level.
